### 1. Login (genera el token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@empresa.com",
  "password": "Admin-123456789"
}

### 2. Login con contraseña incorrecta (debe dar 401)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@empresa.com",
  "password": "incorrecta"
}

### 3. Agregar un ticket
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Ticket creado desde el servicio web",
  "description": "Prueba del endpoint POST",
  "ticketPriorityId": 3,
  "dueDate": "2026-11-20"
}

### 4. Consultar todos los tickets
GET {{host}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Consultar un ticket por id
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Consultar sin token (debe dar 401)
GET {{host}}/api/tickets